    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >'Escape House' is a short (around 30 minutes), walking simulator game wherein the player is paid to partake in an experimental, real-world video game which is currently in development and not yet accessible to the public. Will you partake, and at what cost?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mechanically, the game offers little in the way of game play. But what it lacks in that department, it more than makes up for in atmosphere and tone. Be that through its use of music, narration or (perhaps most predominantly) the many twists and turns within its story. All of which make 'Escape House' a game worth sharing with friends. If for no other reason than to witness their reaction.</p>",
